  "content": "\n\n#\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uzHda1n.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>适用于 Minecraft 1.19.2、1.20.1、1.20.2、1.20.4 的材质包</b>\n</p>\n\n#\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4S8OBXT.png\">\n</p>\n  <p><b>Aether: Regenerated</b> 是一款 Minecraft 材质包，专注于进一步更新 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether\">Aether Mod</a> 中现有的纹理。<br>\n  主要目标是为该维度增添更多原创元素，避免直接使用原版物品/方块的改色贴图，同时也融入了我个人的一些设计巧思。<br>\n  Regenerated 支持多种天界模组的附加组件，未来还将支持更多！目前已支持的模组包括：<br></p>\n    <Table>\n        <TR>\n          <TD><p align=\"center\"><b>附加模组</b></p></TD>\n          <TD>1.19.2</TD>\n          <TD>1.20.1 </TD>\n          <TD>1.21.1</TD>\n        </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-lost-content\">Aether: Lost Content</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>X</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>X</TD>\n      </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\">The Aether: Redux</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>X</TD>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-emissivity\">Aether: Emissivity</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>X</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n      </TR>\n            <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-treasure-reforging\">Aether: Treasure Reforging</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n      </TR>\n            <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-treasure-reforging\">Aether: Treasure Reforging</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n      </TR>\n            <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-overworld-ores\">Aether: Overworld Ores</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>X</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n      </TR>\n            <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deep-aether\">Deep Aether</a></p></TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n        <TD>✓</TD>\n      </TR>\n    </Table>\n  此外，本材质包内置了数个附加资源包，只需打开压缩包进入“addons”文件夹，将其直接拖入“.minecraft/resourcepacks”即可。<br>\n  Regenerated 的内置附加包包括：<br>\n    <Table>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><b>附加包名称</b></p></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">描述</p></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">测试版本</p></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">支持的附加模组</p></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">所需附加模组</p></TD>\n      </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">Vanilla Shaped</p></TD>\n        <TD>使天界工具的造型更贴近原版</TD>\n        <TD>1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.20.4</TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-lost-content\">Aether: Lost Content</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\">The Aether: Redux</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether-emissivity\">Aether: Emissivity</a></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"> X </p></TD>\n      </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">Blue Icestone</p></TD>\n        <TD>将冰石颜色由白色改为蓝色</TD>\n        <TD>1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.20.4</TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"> X </p></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"> X </p></TD>\n      </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">Consistent Bushes</p></TD>\n        <TD>将天界浆果灌木丛的外观与原版甜浆果灌木丛保持一致</TD>\n        <TD>1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.20.4</TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\">The Aether: Redux</a></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"> X </p></TD>\n      </TR>\n      <TR>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\">Super Veridium</p></TD>\n        <TD>将注魔维里迪姆工具改为金色，致敬某只刺猬……</TD>\n        <TD>1.19.2, 1.20.1</TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\">The Aether: Redux</a></TD>\n        <TD><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\">The Aether: Redux</a></TD>\n      </TR>\n    </Table>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
